# Arguments

* `width` - The width component of the `Size`.
* `height` - The height component of the `Size`.

# Examples

```
use kael::size;
let my_size = size(10, 20);
assert_eq!(my_size.width, 10);
assert_eq!(my_size.height, 20);
```

